 "notes": [
  "Free-form handwritten list on plain paper (no PC form); header \"Chris Herr / Forum- Chris Herr\" (forum name taken as username). (V) marks written after card names. Two columns on p5, continued \"(Over)\" on p6; last 4 deck cards and the 12 indented shields on p6. Lines numbered in order: p5 left column, p5 right column, p6.",
  "UNSURE: line 32 \"Control + Thrnen V\" -> Control & Tunnel Vision (the \"V\" read as part of \"Tunnel V[ision]\", not a (V) mark)",
  "line 36 \"Lando w Blaster\" -> Lando With Blaster Pistol (the Rifle version did not exist in 2010)",
  "UNSURE: line 52 \"Eject Eject + Imp Atrocity\" -> Eject! Eject! (no such combo card in DB)"
 ]
